  <item>
    <title>EP7: 24.7.22 就把生活的意外当作是场冒险！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669e68588fcadceb90235cbd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669e68588fcadceb90235cbd</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 14:10:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024week29</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="99">01:39</a>两次私教体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>勇闯健身房之探底4家健身房</span></p><span></span><p><span>——中田&amp;乐刻&amp;鸭嘴兽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 在健身动作、训练计划、饮食方面进行知识积累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 迎接新的工作岗位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="656">10:56</a>快乐周末阅读</span></p><span></span><p><span>《太白金星有点忙》马伯庸</span></p>]]></description>
