  <item>
    <title>EP6 24.7.13 做些什么，能摆脱生活的无意义感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669250ac8fcadceb9009c235</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669250ac8fcadceb9009c235</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Jul 2024 10:02:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024week28</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 更喜欢海边的那种凉爽的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是既然在广州工作生活就接受吧orz</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a>开心的事情分享——抢到了歌剧魅影音乐剧门票</span></p><span></span><p><span>开始了解音乐剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 享受甜乔唱段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 做些什么事情可以拜托无意义的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span>真正享受生活本身呢？什么是有意义的事情呢？怎么保持健康的作息呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>对抗贪婪的多巴胺！尝试阅读、运动、美食、探索兴趣来代替看剧和刷手机</span></p><span></span><p><span>从真正好奇和感兴趣的事情入手，找到生活的意义和秩序感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a>探索健身</span></p><span></span><p><span>完成比完美更重要！希望可以分享健身体验，只有尝试过才知道自己喜不喜欢呀！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj7V-eBwAdQlS6cBpxfN_1B9QqC6.m4a" length="21584971" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKS5z_gLNzGd6Qrh0YTRJ1mO46G.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP5: 旅行|和旧朋友创造新回忆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668d20208fcadceb901e189f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668d20208fcadceb901e189f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 11:33:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年5月的时候和朋友们一起定下的旅行计划，结果只有我和怡姐刚好有时间，于是没怎么犹豫，说走就做，踏上了广西柳州和南宁的旅程。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 柳州行程day1</span></p><span></span><p><span>广州南——五星步行街——窑埠古镇——茶麸洗头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> &nbsp;柳州行程day2</span></p><span></span><p><span>青云市场——龙潭公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 南宁行程day3</span></p><span></span><p><span>广西自壮族治区博物馆——青秀山</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsD39xT9YzUelpiBbY2rqjWmt4a8.m4a" length="21511999" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhC_v50L1q_viC7mW-8YA8oZOARc.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP4:24.6.24 快乐是生活中小而确定的幸福</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667987c4b6a8412729053ad9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667987c4b6a8412729053ad9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Jun 2024 14:50:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天是我断更第三天嘿嘿（心虚的笑了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 安宁的周五之夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>——护发，做饭，电影，早睡</span></p><span></span><p><span>周五那天过得蛮开心的</span></p><span></span><p><span>早早下班 到家之后就护发 洗了头发</span></p><span></span><p><span>晚上还看完了一部电影——“绣春刀”</span></p><span></span><p><span>并且没有熬夜 按时睡了觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="194">03:14</a>周六是充实繁忙的一周</span></p><span></span><p><span>早上起床洗被子 买菜 化妆</span></p><span></span><p><span>去博物馆看展（没赶上/(ㄒoㄒ)/~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>发现博物馆纪念周边——盖章本</span></p><span></span><p><span>不健康的饮食和没完成的早睡计划！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a>周日大姨妈的突然到访</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a>周一开心的事情：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我终于换新的电脑啦！o(*￣▽￣*)ブ</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>皮肤预警！！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>连续四天的规律作息，保持运动，姨妈到访，皮肤往好处发展</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>但是周六日熬夜+饮食不注意（炸物 雪糕 蛋糕 三盒薯片）</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>提到的博主@张雅琪不社牛</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>整理书桌~</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>介绍花花~</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsu4EzoJQ4P9W9a55UzuMnpkKN2E.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lo1G8_tgaMJHeCquNA7XKmpJw0QN.m4a" length="13166526" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:10</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkc0dF5GZMqEvN3lmCmzMETaIivj.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP3:24.6.20 敏感的人都是能够与命运共舞的人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667433b6b6a84127292dc843</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667433b6b6a84127292dc843</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 13:50:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的封面是我下班后回家看到的洒满地板和沙发的阳光</span></p><span></span><p><span>与你分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望也能驱走你的阴霾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 马上就能用上不卡的电脑啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a>唯有运动能打败席卷而来的坏情绪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a>长痘痘的少女没有青春</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a>独居久了 愈发对享受孤独这件事情上瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a>能坚持做日更博客的人真的很厉害</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr8aqmVwclER1ysDf3a9jinRrRzE.m4a" length="14359854" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:14:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQdqC3GBlcsoEw9xxMvhdspPkbh.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
